  "findings": [
    "Studio Next's transaction record has no resultName/statusName: status is a string, the consensus result is result_name / numeric result. The console's and the script's receipt checks read all three spellings and treat a name/number conflict as malformed.",
    "sim_fundAccount credits only the EIP-55 checksummed address.",
    "Writes and deploys need a full fee object (feeValue + distribution); a bare feeValue still reverts with FeeValueMustBeNonZero(1).",
    "withdraw_released's fee estimate includes ~0.12 GEN of message fees for the queued transfer.",
    "emit_transfer(on='accepted') is rejected by Studio Next; emit_transfer(on='finalized') is recorded on the finalized transaction but the value is not delivered (see payout_probe). Treat pull payments as UNVERIFIED on this network and verify on a network where native payouts are delivered before relying on them.",
    "A view reporting solvent=true is not evidence that a payout was delivered: it compares the contract's balance with its accounting, and an undelivered transfer leaves the balance high."
  ],
  "superseded": {
    "note": "The first deployment ran the previous contract revision (validators compared the release tag only; get_vault_state mis-projected the next tranche after a top-up). It is left on-chain, unused, and was never seeded with a vault.",
